sequenceDiagram
 participant M as Mobile
 participant A as API
 participant P as PostgreSQL
 participant W as Worker
 M->>A: replacement (idempotency key)
 A->>P: refresh request + job
 W->>P: lease request
 W->>W: generate/validate replacement
 W->>P: link old/new item and accept refresh
 A-->>M: current revision
